{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51470","headline":"早春送友人归江南 · 李郢","name":"早春送友人归江南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭归客莫相催，予忆沧江久未迥。\n归渡遇霜杨柳尽，寒郊欲雪鶺鴒来。\n舟依青路帆初挂，鸟出红尘眼渐开。\n千里同来不同去，莫惊愁泪溅离杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51470.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51470","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}